<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea First Bank limit low on Hanbo news.</title>
<headline>Korea First Bank limit low on Hanbo news.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Korea First Bank, a main creditor to ailing Hanbo Steel Corp, fell 360 won to its lower limit of 4,220 in early Friday morning trading.</p>
<p>Brokers said Hanbo's default on an unspecified amount of loans late on Thursday sent investors scurrying for cover.</p>
</text>
